  "prefLabel": "Rev 1003.07 Accounting",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1003.07 Accounting. Pursuant to Rev 1008.03, every wholesaler shall file a monthly accounting of all OTP, cigarettes, and little cigars as described in Rev 1002.01(f), and RYO, transferred to and from any premises in this state where such tobacco products are possessed, stored, or sold.\n\nSource. #13049, eff 6-4-20 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Rev 1000); ss by #13817, eff 12-1-23 (formerly Rev 1003.021) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Rev 1000)",
